OL,3,AHeart, hope and a steely determination:
OL,4,ADolly Parton's musical legacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FExcited, she ran over and sang the song
OL,7,Fto her co-stars Lily Tomlin and Jane
OL,8,FFonda, who was also the film's
OL,9,Fproducer.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
